diagram class
notation Starr
presentation default
orientation landscape
color blue steel
sheet A1
padding l50 b50
frame Model Integration Diagram
frame_presentation default
nodes
    Controlling Program/2 11,1
    Cued Program 9,2
    Organ 12,3
    Pace Program 10,3
    Region 12,5-6
    Region Stimulation/2 10,6-7
    Event 12,7-8
    Region Schedule 9,5
    Intrinsic Event 12-13,9
    Pace Event 11,9
connectors
    -R1 : +/2 r|Organ : +/1 l*|Region
    -R2-1 : +/2 r|Region : +/2 l*|Event, t|Region Stimulation
    -R3 : +/2 r|Pace Program : +/1 l*|Region Stimulation, t|Region Schedule
    +R10 : r|Event { l|Intrinsic Event, l|Pace Event }
    +R15 : +/2 b+2|Organ : +/2 t*|Pace Program
    +R19 : -/1 b-2|Organ : -/1 t*|Pace Program, r|Controlling Program
    +R20.2 : -/2 l|Pace Program : +/2 b|Controlling Program, t|Cued Program
